{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UELubtPrWsxkKjL84cS4Pm","type":"tool_result","content":"| Plan | Monthly | Yearly (billed annually) | Credits/month | Concurrent requests | Key features |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Free | $0 | n/a | 1,000 (500 searches or 1,000 pages) | 2 | No card required, low rate limits |\n| Hobby | $19 | $16/mo ($38 saved/yr) | 5,000 (2,500 searches or 5,000 pages) | 5 | Basic support, pay-as-you-go |\n| Standard (recommended) | Not listed | $83/mo ($198 saved/yr) | 100,000 (50,000 searches or 100,000 pages) | 25 | Standard support, pay-as-you-go |\n| Growth | Not listed | $333/mo ($798 saved/yr) | 500,000 (250,000 searches or 500,000 pages) | 50 | Priority support, pay-as-you-go |\n| Scale | Not listed | $599/mo ($1,798 saved/yr) | 1,000,000 (500,000 searches or 1,000,000 pages) | 100 | Priority support, pay-as-you-go |\n| Enterprise | Custom | Custom | Custom | Custom | Dedicated support and SLA, bulk discounts, zero-data retention, SSO and advanced security |\n\n**Cheapest paid plan: Hobby** at $19/month billed monthly, or $16/month billed yearly. It includes 5,000 credits per month (2,500 searches or 5,000 pages), 5 concurrent requests, basic support, and pay-as-you-go access, where 1,000 extra credits cost $5."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"64c50141-47c9-4d4c-9292-60c74354fcfe","uuid":"74cb179b-bbe9-4433-acf4-ffb2f8d02991","timestamp":"2026-10-17T02:35:47.968Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":799542,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"| Plan | Monthly | Yearly (billed annually) | Credits/month | Concurrent requests | Key features |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Free | $0 | n/a | 1,000 (500 searches or 1,000 pages) | 2 | No card required, low rate limits |\n| Hobby | $19 | $16/mo ($38 saved/yr) | 5,000 (2,500 searches or 5,000 pages) | 5 | Basic support, pay-as-you-go |\n| Standard (recommended) | Not listed | $83/mo ($198 saved/yr) | 100,000 (50,000 searches or 100,000 pages) | 25 | Standard support, pay-as-you-go |\n| Growth | Not listed | $333/mo ($798 saved/yr) | 500,000 (250,000 searches or 500,000 pages) | 50 | Priority support, pay-as-you-go |\n| Scale | Not listed | $599/mo ($1,798 saved/yr) | 1,000,000 (500,000 searches or 1,000,000 pages) | 100 | Priority support, pay-as-you-go |\n| Enterprise | Custom | Custom | Custom | Custom | Dedicated support and SLA, bulk discounts, zero-data retention, SSO and advanced security |\n\n**Cheapest paid plan: Hobby** at $19/month billed monthly, or $16/month billed yearly. It includes 5,000 credits per month (2,500 searches or 5,000 pages), 5 concurrent requests, basic support, and pay-as-you-go access, where 1,000 extra credits cost $5.","durationMs":6840,"url":"https://www.firecrawl.dev/pricing"},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01UELubtPrWsxkKjL84cS4Pm","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg72hsJmHQcDdN55EKBLW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Firecrawl's cheapest paid plan is **Hobby**. It costs **$19/month** billed monthly, or **$16/month** billed yearly, which saves $38 a year.\n\n**What you get:**\n- 5,000 credits per month. That's about 5,000 scraped pages or 2,500 searches.\n- 5 concurrent requests.\n- Basic support.\n- Pay-as-you-go top-ups, at $5 per extra 1,000 credits.\n\nThe Free tier is $0 with 1,000 credits and 2 concurrent requests, and it needs no card. The next paid tier, Standard, is $83/month billed yearly. It gives 100,000 credits and 25 concurrent requests. The pricing page didn't list a monthly price for Standard.\n\nI got this from the pricing page just now, and the figures can change.\n\nSources: [Firecrawl pricing](https://www.firecrawl.dev/pricing)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":703,"cache_read_input_tokens":18975,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":703},"output_tokens":304,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"64c50141-47c9-4d4c-9292-60c74354fcfe","uuid":"9cd52b0a-721a-4c82-a0d4-326436bb9790","timestamp":"2026-10-17T02:35:50.568Z","request_id":"req_011Cg72hs5dJP29FEiMkkmxR"}
